<title>FRANCE: S&amp;P puts Selectibanque on credit watch.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P puts Selectibanque on credit watch.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>S&amp;P-ADEF said on Friday it had put property credit group Selectibanque's short and long-term paper ratings of A- and A-2 on credit watch with negative implications because of a weaker profit profile, following aggressive external growth in 1995.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it would meet management in the coming weeks to discuss the financial situation of the group as well as its position within the Suez group.</p>
</text>
